  "$comment": "Three superstates on modern province geometry, after the world of George Orwell's Nineteen Eighty-Four. What is taken from the novel is its PREMISE and the three names -- a partition of the globe, which is an idea rather than protected expression, and three short names, which copyright does not reach. No text from the book is reproduced anywhere in this file or in the game; every description here is written for this scenario. Flags are procedural patterns from each power's colour, so no artwork is copied either. See docs/scenario-licensing.md.",
